      "content": "What the wiki is\nA multi-level documentation system auto-generated from your codebase. It serves three audiences: new team members getting oriented, LLM agents investigating before starting a task, and search queries (\"what files handle authentication?\").\n\n\nThe 4 levels\nLevel\tWhat it is\tWhere it lives\nL0 Home\tProject README + overview\twiki/home.md\nL1 Domains\tClusters of related files (e.g. \"Auth\", \"API layer\")\twiki/domains/<slug>.md\nL2 Modules\tPer-file technical page: imports, exports, callers\twiki/modules/<file>.md\nL3 Files\tAI-written summary of a single source file\tper wiki category\n\n\nWiki has changed, use the new endpoints",
